# Fallbacks for what the seed itself relies on. Fedora's presets enable all of
# this too, and its 90-default.preset sorts first, so its policy wins; but not
# every package set comes with Fedora's presets (e.g. Hummingbird). This sorts
# before systemd's own 90-systemd.preset.
# The system bus, for logind and PAM sessions:
enable dbus.socket
enable dbus-broker.service
# ostree's remounting at boot:
enable ostree-remount.service
# The build drops authselect's state from /var; this re-applies it at boot:
enable authselect-apply-changes.service
